  "changesHere": "Selected and merged the source meshes in src/endocrine/source/structures.source.json; welded coincident vertices; simplified the large HRA meshes with meshoptimizer within the relative error bounds given there (largest error used: 0.937 %); subdivided and smoothed the small parts; recomputed smooth normals; placed the BodyParts3D parts onto the HRA body; pushed the adrenal glands and stomach out of the organs they overlapped; split the pituitary; generated the thyroid, parathyroids, pituitary stalk and adrenal medulla; traced the hormone routes; translated so the middle of the glands is the origin.",
